            "turn": "Your turn",
            "phase": "Shooting phase",
            "description": "<b>WHEN:</b> Your Shooting phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Adeptus Astartes Infantry or Adeptus Astartes Mounted unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the end of the phase, add 2 to the Strength characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit.",
